		"ja": [
			"プラモデルで戦う特撮ドラマ『ガールガンレディ』始動！",
			"ドラマの世界に入り込み、ヒロインたちの活躍を追体験できるプラモデル登場！",
			"• TVに登場する指揮官、レディコマンダービアンカそのもののキット。撮影に使用しているプラモデルだから劇中のポーズをそのまま再現できる。",
			"• 付属の表情パーツでキャラクターの個性を再現。",
			"• 専用台座付属。",
			"• ハンドパーツは平手のほか、握り手、指差し手も付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Special effects drama “Girl Gun Lady” that uses plastic models to fight has started!",
			"Introducing a plastic model that allows you to enter the world of the drama and relive the heroines' activities!",
			"• Kit is Lady Commander Bianca, the commander who appears on TV. Since it is a plastic model used for filming, you can recreate the pose in the movie as it is.",
			"• Reproduce the character's personality with the included facial parts.",
			"• Comes with a special pedestal.",
			"• In addition to the open hand, hand parts include a gripping hand and a pointing hand."
		]
